{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01268","headline":"相和歌辞 胡无人行 · 聂夷中","name":"相和歌辞 胡无人行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"男儿徇大义，立节不沽名。\n腰间悬陆离，大歌胡无行。\n不读战国书，不览黄石经。\n醉卧咸阳楼，梦入受降城。\n更愿生羽翼，飞身入青冥。\n请携天子劒，斫下旄头星。\n自然胡无人，虽有无战争。\n悠哉典属国，驱羊老一生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"聂夷中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}